    "long_instructions": "## **Explore and Explain**\r\n\r\n### Do This:\r\n\r\n1. In the **searh bar**, try searching for `b`, `blu`, ` blue`, and then clear the box.\r\n\r\n2. In **script.js**, find `searchColors()`.\r\n\r\n3. Use AI:\r\n\r\n   * Copy the function\r\n   * Ask at least **two questions**, such as:\r\n\r\n     * Where does `query` come from?\r\n     * Why use lowercase?\r\n     * How does it decide which paints to keep?\r\n\r\n4. Add `//` comments above the function explaining:\r\n\r\n   * how it handles uppercase/lowercase\r\n   * how it decides which paints to keep\r\n",
